Resource    taf/rfrl/procedures/resources/robot/Counters.robot

Library     OperatingSystem
Library     taf.rfrl.procedures.resources.python.simulator.airphone.Airphone  WITH NAME  simulator

*** Keywords ***

CB006449_AB_B3_UL_suspend_resume_on_SCell_with_T_T_intra_band_cont_UL_2CCs_CA
    [Documentation]  This test case describes the steps needed to verify interworking with CB010701.
    ...              CB010701 extends FR1 TDD + FDD UL CA so that UL MIMO can be used in TDD carrier, achieving better throughput for UL CA.
    ...              In this scenario a further FR1 TDD cell is added as a candidate for UL CA to verify that the algorithm still selects the best option between T + F UL CA, T+T UL CA  or  UL MIMO on TDD Cell.
    ...              UEs, which are capable of 3Tx transmission and within gNB configured bands have band combination with 1 layer UL for FDD band and 2 layer UL for TDD band,
    ...              shall be connected to the TDD FR1 cell as PCell  to support 2 layer UL transmission and FDD cell as DL and UL SCell to support 1 layer UL transmission.
    ...
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              expected_throughputs (dict):   dict with expected throughput (in Mbps) and deviation (in %) values
    ...                                             for each cell identified by its index, e.g.:
    ...                              {
    ...                                'CellIndex-0':
    ...                                {
    ...                                    'throughput':
    ...                                    {
    ...                                        'uplink': 10,
    ...                                        'downlink': 20
    ...                                    },
    ...                                    'deviation': 5
    ...                                },
    ...                                'CellIndex-1':
    ...                                {
    ...                                    'throughput':
    ...                                    {
    ...                                        'uplink': 15.5,
    ...                                        'downlink': 25
    ...                                    },
    ...                                    'deviation': 10.5
    ...                                },
    ...                             }
    ...              ue_capability_file (str):  Path to the UE capability cfg file to be used for the test.

    [Arguments]      ${throughputs}
    ...              ${ue_capability_file}
    [Timeout]        24 hours

    ${ue_capability_file}=                                   Copy File    ${ue_capability_file}  /tmp/ue_capability_file.cfg
    simulator.setup_custom_ue_radio_capabilities             ue_id=1
    ...                                                      ue_nr_capabilities=UE_UL_CA_CAPA_M80 capability_file=${ue_capability_file}
    Attach UE to the TDD NR cell0
    ${dl_trf_ids}  ${ul_trf_ids}                             CB006449_AB Initiate Data Transmission
    ...                                                      throughputs=${throughputs}
    Increase Attenuation To Suspend UL Data Transmission
    Continue To Increase Attenuation On PCell
    ${M55316C00032_value}=                                   Get SCELL_UL_SUSPEND_PCEL_POWLM_SA Counter Value
    Decrease Attenuation On PCell
    Continue To Decrease Attenuation On PCell To Resume UL Data Transmission
    ${M55316C15016_value}=                                   Get SCELL_SUSP_RECOV_SA Counter Value
    Keep Attenuation Unchanged On PCell And Increase Attenuation On SCell
    Decrease attenuation on SCell
    ${dl_tput_report}  ${ul_tput_report}                     CB006449_AB Get Data Transfer Reports
    CB006449_AB Stop Data Transmission                       dl_trf_ids=${dl_trf_ids}
    ...                                                      ul_trf_ids=${ul_trf_ids}
    CB006449_AB Verify Data Transmission And Counter Results
    ...                                                      M55316C00032_value=${M55316C00032_value}
    ...                                                      M55316C15016_value=${M55316C15016_value}
    ...                                                      throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                      dl_tput_report=${dl_tput_report}
    ...                                                      ul_tput_report=${ul_tput_report}

Attach UE to the TDD NR cell0
    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Attaching UE to the TDD NR cell0...
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd                              cmd=set_pdu_param ue=1 pdu=1 trf_type=internal
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ue_register id=1
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=Received REGISTRATION COMPLETE from UE
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ue_pdu_session_setup pdu=1 ue=1 nwslice=1 gw=1
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=UE-1 PDU SESSION ID-1 setup/reestablishment complete

    Robot Log Result                                         msg=UE successfully attached to the TDD NR cell0!

CB006449_AB Initiate Data Transmission
    [Arguments]                                              ${throughputs}
    ${trf_id}=                                               Set Variable    1
    ${dl_trf_ids}=                                           Create List
    ${ul_trf_ids}=                                           Create List

    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Initiating data transmission...
    FOR  ${cell_data}  IN  @{throughputs.values()}
        TRY
            simulator.start_downlink_data_transfer           ue_id=1
            ...                                              pdu_id=1
            ...                                              qfi_id=1
            ...                                              trf_id=${trf_id}
            ...                                              protocol=udp
            ...                                              throughput=${cell_data['throughput']['downlink']}
            Append To List                                   ${dl_trf_ids}
            ...                                              ${trf_id}
            ${trf_id}=                                       Evaluate    ${trf_id} + 1
        EXCEPT  *KeyError: 'downlink'*    type=GLOB
            No Operation
        END
        TRY
            simulator.start_uplink_data_transfer             ue_id=1
            ...                                              pdu_id=1
            ...                                              qfi_id=1
            ...                                              trf_id=${trf_id}
            ...                                              protocol=udp
            ...                                              throughput=${cell_data['throughput']['uplink']}
            Append To List                                   ${ul_trf_ids}
            ...                                              ${trf_id}
            ${trf_id}=                                       Evaluate    ${trf_id} + 1
        EXCEPT  *KeyError: 'uplink'*    type=GLOB
            No Operation
        END
    END

    Robot Log Result                                         msg=Data transmission initiated successfully!\nDownlink transfer IDs: ${dl_trf_ids}.\nUplink transfer IDs: ${ul_trf_ids}
    ...                                                      to_console=${True}
    [Return]                                                 ${dl_trf_ids}
    ...                                                      ${ul_trf_ids}


CB006449_AB Stop Data Transmission
    [Arguments]                                              ${dl_trf_ids}
    ...                                                      ${ul_trf_ids}

    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Stopping data transmission...
    FOR  ${trf_id}  IN  @{dl_trf_ids}
        simulator.stop_downlink_data_transfer                ue_id=1
        ...                                                  pdu_id=1
        ...                                                  qfi_id=1
        ...                                                  trf_id=${trf_id}
    END
    FOR  ${trf_id}  IN  @{ul_trf_ids}
        simulator.stop_uplink_data_transfer                  ue_id=1
        ...                                                  pdu_id=1
        ...                                                  qfi_id=1
        ...                                                  trf_id=${trf_id}
    END

    Robot Log Result                                         msg=Data transmission stopped successfully!

CB006449_AB Get Data Transfer Reports
    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Getting data transfer reports...
    ${dl_tput_report}=                                       simulator.get_data_transfer_results
    ...                                                      ue_id=1
    ...                                                      scell=0-2
    ...                                                      stat_type=pdsch
    ${ul_tput_report}=                                       simulator.get_data_transfer_results
    ...                                                      ue_id=1
    ...                                                      scell=0-2
    ...                                                      stat_type=pusch

    Robot Log Result                                         msg=Data transfer reports received successfully!
    [Return]                                                 ${dl_tput_report}
    ...                                                      ${ul_tput_report}


CB006449_AB Verify Data Transmission And Counter Results
    [Arguments]                                              ${M55316C00032_value}
    ...                                                      ${M55316C15016_value}
    ...                                                      ${throughputs}
    ...                                                      ${dl_tput_report}
    ...                                                      ${ul_tput_report}
    
    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Verifying data transmission and counter results...
    ${dl_status}    ${dl_msg}=                               Run Keyword And Ignore Error
    ...                                                      simulator.verify_data_transfer_results
    ...                                                      transfer_data=${dl_tput_report}
    ...                                                      throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                      verify_total_avg_tput=True
    ...                                                      total_avg_deviation=5
    ${ul_status}    ${ul_msg}=                               Run Keyword And Ignore Error
    ...                                                      simulator.verify_data_transfer_results
    ...                                                      transfer_data=${ul_tput_report}
    ...                                                      throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                      verify_total_avg_tput=True
    ...                                                      total_avg_deviation=5
    ${M55316C00032_counter_status}    ${counter_msg}=        Run Keyword And Ignore Error
    ...                                                      Should Be Equal As Numbers
    ...                                                      ${M55316C00032_value[0]['NRCELL-2/NRUC/M55316C00032'][0]}  1
    ...                                                      msg=After full 5min data transfer cycle, counter M55316C00032 value for NRCELL-2 should be equal 1
    ${M55316C15016_counter_status}    ${counter_msg}=        Run Keyword And Ignore Error
    ...                                                      Should Be Equal As Numbers
    ...                                                      ${M55316C15016_value[0]['NRCELL-1/NRUC/M55316C15016'][0]}  1
    ...                                                      msg=After full 5min data transfer cycle, counter M55316C15016 value for NRCELL-1 should be equal 1  

    Run Keyword If                                           """${dl_status}""" != """PASS""" or """${ul_status}""" != """PASS"""  or """${M55316C00032_counter_status}""" != """PASS""" or """${M55316C15016_counter_status}""" != """PASS"""
    ...                                                      Fail
    ...                                                      msg=\n\n1. DL verification status: ${dl_status} - ${dl_msg}\n\n2. UL verification status: ${ul_status} - ${ul_msg}\n\n3. SCELL_UL_SUSPEND_PCEL_POWLM_SA counter verification status: ${M55316C00032_counter_status} - ${counter_msg}\n\n4. SCELL_SUSP_RECOV_SA counter verification status: ${M55316C15016_counter_status} - ${counter_msg}\n\n


Increase Attenuation To Suspend UL Data Transmission
    Wait For New Counters Data Frame Generation              data_frame_interval=5min
    Robot Log Operation                                      Increasing attenuation on PCell to suspend UL data transmission.
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd                              cmd=ul_sinr_testmode_nr profile_id=1 pathloss=90
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd                              cmd=ue_testmode_set_nr scell=0 id=1 testmode=ul_sinr action=activate profile_id=1
    Sleep                                                    120
    ...                                                      reason=Waiting for UL data transmission to be suspended
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ue_stats_nr id=1 scell=0-2 type=pusch
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=CellIndex-1\\s+0\\s+Kbps\\s+0\\s+Kbps\\s+0\\s+Kbps\\s+0\\s+Kbps
    ...                                                      timeout=90s
    Robot Log Result                                         UL data transmission is suspended on SCell

Continue To Increase Attenuation On PCell
    Robot Log Operation                                      Continuing to increase attenuation on PCell, until transform precoder is reconfigured to "enabled" from "disabled" on PCell.
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ul_sinr_testmode_nr profile_id=1 pathloss=117
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=transformPrecoder enabled
    Robot Log Result                                         Transform precoder successfully reconfigured to "enabled" on PCell!

Get SCELL_UL_SUSPEND_PCEL_POWLM_SA Counter Value
    ${counter_list}=                                         Create List    M55316C00032
    ${counter_value}=                                        Wait for End of Current Counters Frame and Collect Counters
    ...                                                      data_frame_interval=5min
    ...                                                      counter_ids=${counter_list}
    ...                                                      component_name=NRCELL-2

    [Return]                                                 ${counter_value}

Decrease Attenuation On PCell
    Robot Log Operation                                      Decreasing attenuation on PCell, until transform precoder is reconfigured to "disabled" on PCell.
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ul_sinr_testmode_nr profile_id=1 pathloss=111
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=transformPrecoder disabled
    Robot Log Result                                         Transform precoder successfully reconfigured to "disabled" on PCell!

Continue To Decrease Attenuation On PCell To Resume UL Data Transmission
    Wait For New Counters Data Frame Generation              data_frame_interval=5min
    Robot Log Operation                                      Continuing to decrease attenuation on PCell, until UL data transmission is resumed on SCell0.
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd                              cmd=ue_testmode_set_nr scell=0 id=1 testmode=ul_sinr action=deactivate profile_id=1
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd                              cmd=ue_testmode_set_nr scell=1 id=1 testmode=ul_sinr action=deactivate profile_id=1
    Sleep                                                    120
    ...                                                      reason=Waiting for UL data transmission to be resumed
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ue_stats_nr id=1 scell=0-2 type=pusch
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=CellIndex-1(\\s+\\d+(\\.\\d+)?\\s+Mbps){4}
    ...                                                      timeout=90s
    Robot Log Result                                         UL data transmission is successfully resumed on SCell!

Get SCELL_SUSP_RECOV_SA Counter Value
    ${counter_list}=                                         Create List    M55316C15016
    ${counter_value}=                                        Wait for End of Current Counters Frame and Collect Counters
    ...                                                      data_frame_interval=5min
    ...                                                      counter_ids=${counter_list}
    ...                                                      component_name=NRCELL-1

    [Return]                                                 ${counter_value}

Keep Attenuation Unchanged On PCell And Increase Attenuation On SCell
    Robot Log Operation                                      Increasing attenuation on SCell to verify that transform precoder is reconfigured to "enabled" on SCell.
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd                              cmd=ul_sinr_testmode_nr profile_id=2 pathloss=130
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ue_testmode_set_nr scell=1 id=1 testmode=ul_sinr action=activate profile_id=2
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=transformPrecoder enabled
    Robot Log Result                                         Transform precoder successfully reconfigured to "enabled" on SCell!

Decrease attenuation on SCell
    Robot Log Operation                                      Decreasing attenuation on SCell, until transform precoder is reconfigured to "disabled" on SCell.
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ul_sinr_testmode_nr profile_id=2 pathloss=110
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=transformPrecoder disabled
    Robot Log Result                                         Transform precoder successfully reconfigured to "disabled" on SCell!
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd                              cmd=ue_testmode_set_nr scell=0 id=1 testmode=ul_sinr action=deactivate profile_id=2
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd                              cmd=ue_testmode_set_nr scell=1 id=1 testmode=ul_sinr action=deactivate profile_id=2
    Sleep                                                    120
    ...                                                      reason=Waiting for tput to be stable after attenuation change
